---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About"
	description="About Artificial Amateur"
	pubDate={new Date()}
>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm [your name]. I'm not an AI expert — I'm an amateur figuring it out in public. This
		blog is where I write down what I'm learning as I go: tools I'm trying, things that worked,
		things that didn't, and whatever I pick up along the way.
	</p>

	<p>
		[Add a bit more here: what got you interested in AI, what you're hoping to learn, or what
		kind of posts people can expect — quick experiments, longer write-ups, tool reviews, etc.]
	</p>

	<p>
		You can reach me at [your email or contact link].
	</p>
</Layout>
